{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云徧一切處，亦云光明徧照。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音證，直視貌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音蒙，昏悶不了也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云圓生忉利天樹，華開香徧五十由旬。又翻間錯莊嚴，眾雜色華周匝莊嚴故。又\n\n云香徧樹，根、莖、枝、葉、膚、實，莫不皆香故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音瞻部，此云黃色華，最香，形似梔子華，其樹高\n大。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻高山，或云牛頭，亦云離垢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云無熱惱池名也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云亦色香名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云速疾鬼，又云可畏暴惡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云善時，\n分時唱妙善樂故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華言知足，於五欲境知止足故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云石鹽，其香似之。\n醎水、馬器皆云先陀婆，今應用醎也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "老，病貌。謂老來腰灣背跎，猶如龍之鍾曲也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音阿，病也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云不可往山也，佛在此說，名楞伽經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻無生應供殺賊四果也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻預流初果也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻佛立常行三昧也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音王，心不暇也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音亮，車輛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華言無貧，亦云如意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂浮塵根、勝義根也。六根中各各具此二種。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音迢，搖動也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即涅槃音轉耳，此云入滅。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六根、六塵、六識也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語閱頭檀，亦翻真淨，白淨王名也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音執，與哲同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音補申時。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云天帝網。"}
